# Rule 2 — Scan 30 before apply

**Strict rule:** Do not start applying to any Naukri job until Cosmo has **30 preference-matched** jobs queued.

- Phase 1: open All Filters, apply prefs, scan/scroll and **auto next-page** until `matched >= 30`. **Never ask** the user to click “Next page”.
- Phase 2: only then apply one by one (with humanPace slowdown).
- When applies finish, tell the user **all jobs matched and applied** (dashboard close) — do not prompt for another Next page.
- If fewer than 30 matches exist after exhausting pages, **do not apply** — report the shortfall; do not block on a Next-page modal.
- Never call Easy Apply while the matched batch is still under 30.
